\begin_layout Standard
The analysis also yiedls a strong correlation 
\begin_inset Formula $\rho=0.83$
\end_inset

 between inequality and 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

 as measured by the Gini coefficient for wealth,
 which exhibits a similar qualitative pattern.
 In both cases,
 the two rightmost observations,
 marked with triangles and lying below the main trend,
 correspond to the pandemic years (2020 and 2021).
 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
%% $p = 2 
