 and the Gini coefficients (income and wealth) for the population-weighted annual average of the 22 selected countries over a 25-year period.
 With the marking in the star of the years related to 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

Great Recession
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

